  "content": {
    "_uid": "2988ee74-672f-267a-481d-ce54002b1427",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "9c0245bd-6a75-ff31-7b50-bdb1dd2efbe7",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "The Chancellor's gift of spectacular Aga Khan Garden is a symbol of the continued intellectual, educational and cultural collaboration between the University of Alberta and the Aga Khan Development Network.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "The University of Alberta and Aga Khan University have been working together for decades. In 2017, the universities ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "renewed a memorandum of understanding",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "/news/aga-khan-gift-creates-spectacular-new-garden-for-research-and-learning",
                        "uuid": "7eb0b131-d8ab-5978-93d4-86694e48ed2f",
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "story"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ", originally signed in 2006, to move forward their respective goals of increasing global engagement and promoting equitable human development for citizens around the world.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Learn more on ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "AKDN",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.akdn.org/press-release/aga-khan-garden-inaugurated-canada",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " and ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "UoA",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.ualberta.ca/news-and-events",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " websites.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
